{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/window\/dialogsuppressiontoggle(_:issuppressed:)-1e9ay"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"dialogSuppressionToggle","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"label","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Text","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4TextV","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isSuppressed","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Binding","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI7BindingV","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Binding"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"label","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The label of the suppression toggle in the dialog. This"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter can be elided to use the default suppression title."}]}]},{"name":"isSuppressed","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether the suppression toggle is on or off in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dialog."}]}]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Applying dialog suppression adds a toggle to dialogs on Windows,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which allows the user to request the alert not be displayed again."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Typically whether a dialog is suppressed is stored in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppStorage"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and used to decide whether to present the dialog in the future."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example configures an alert with a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"suppression toggle. The toggle’s state is stored in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppStorage"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"used to determine whether or not to show the dialog when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“Delete Items” button is pressed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["struct MyApp: App {","    @State private var isShowingDialog = false","    @AppStorage(\"suppressEraseItemAlert\")","    private var suppressAlert = false","","    var body: some Scene {","        Window(...) {","            Button(\"Delete items\") {","                isShowingDialog = true","            }","        }","","        AlertScene(","            \"Are you sure you want to erase these items?\",","            isPresented: $isShowingDialog","        ) {","            Button(\"Erase\", role: .destructive) {","                \/\/ Handle item deletion.","            }","            Button(\"Cancel\", role: .cancel) {","                \/\/ Handle cancellation","            }","        }","        .dialogSuppressionToggle(","            \"Do not ask about erasing items again\",","            isSuppressed: $suppressAlert)","    }","}"],"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"schema